WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.262 --> 00:00:08.720
Good evening.

2
00:00:09.338 --> 00:00:13.070
I'm Mister Boxington, and I'll be your cache.

3
00:00:13.768 --> 00:00:15.875
Cargo plans the build.

4
00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.070
I wrap each compile.

5
00:00:19.428 --> 00:00:22.932
Do carry on typing cargo build.

6
00:00:22.932 --> 00:00:28.095
build build build build build build build build build build build

7
00:00:28.095 --> 00:00:31.655
Third worktree and the fan's on high

8
00:00:31.655 --> 00:00:35.470
Same old crates go scrolling by

9
00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.240
Tea's gone cold, the build's not through

10
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:42.380
Every checkout starts brand new

11
00:00:42.380 --> 00:00:43.335
Dreadful.

12
00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:46.850
Targets piling, never swept

13
00:00:46.995 --> 00:00:50.105
Who'll collect the ones I left?

14
00:00:50.105 --> 00:00:52.450
Allow me. I'll adopt them.

15
00:00:53.885 --> 00:00:55.710
Same source!

16
00:00:55.745 --> 00:00:57.580
Same features!

17
00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.300
Same profile!

18
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.310
Same toolchain!

19
00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.590
New path, then?

20
00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:03.950
SAME KEYS!

21
00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.435
Three cheers for cargo build!

22
00:01:06.435 --> 00:01:07.180
Hip hip!

23
00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.280
Hooray!

24
00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.015
Hip hip!

25
00:01:09.015 --> 00:01:10.120
Hooray!

26
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:10.855
Hip hip!

27
00:01:10.855 --> 00:01:11.970
Hooray!

28
00:01:11.970 --> 00:01:12.700
Hip hip!

29
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.140
Hooray!

30
00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.235
Pray silence for...

31
00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.435
Mister Boxington!

32
00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:25.150
Mister Boxington!

33
00:01:27.275 --> 00:01:28.870
Mister Boxington!

34
00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.600
Mister Boxington!

35
00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.340
Quite.

36
00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:40.030
qu-qu-qu-qu-qu-qu-quite!

37
00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:43.750
Mister Boxington!

38
00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:55.165
Same crates, new worktree?

39
00:01:55.165 --> 00:01:55.700
HIT!

40
00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:56.840
The crate you edited?

41
00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:57.470
YOURS!

42
00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:58.700
It compiles.

43
00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.705
Amber on the build bar?

44
00:01:59.705 --> 00:02:00.235
MISS!

45
00:02:00.235 --> 00:02:02.495
mbx explain --last.

46
00:02:02.495 --> 00:02:03.760
Cold store, first build?

47
00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:04.835
NOT YET!

48
00:02:04.835 --> 00:02:05.525
Give it a build.

49
00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:06.540
Two builds at once?

50
00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:07.135
SHARED!

51
00:02:07.135 --> 00:02:08.400
After you.

52
00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.040
Pull request on CI?

53
00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:10.840
RESTORE!

54
00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:11.750
Push to main?

55
00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:12.455
PUBLISH!

56
00:02:12.455 --> 00:02:13.485
And who am I?

57
00:02:13.485 --> 00:02:15.395
MISTER BOXINGTON!

58
00:02:15.395 --> 00:02:16.700
Charmed.

59
00:02:17.035 --> 00:02:20.770
I turned up late on a different path

60
00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:24.490
With nothing built and no one I knew

61
00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.375
You didn't ask me where I'm from

62
00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:31.615
Just the files and flags I use

63
00:02:31.615 --> 00:02:35.565
What matched was folded on the shelf

64
00:02:35.565 --> 00:02:39.240
Before I'd made a sound

65
00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:43.380
A different door, the very same keys

66
00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:46.390
And you showed me round

67
00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.605
I appear to be wearing a strawberry.

68
00:02:48.605 --> 00:02:51.925
No space left on device.

69
00:02:51.925 --> 00:02:55.610
Every folder, just in case

70
00:02:55.610 --> 00:03:00.625
Every case, a little less space

71
00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:02.280
Worktree deleted?

72
00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.275
COLLECTED!

73
00:03:03.275 --> 00:03:04.645
Shall I tidy up?

74
00:03:04.645 --> 00:03:06.205
Yes, please!

75
00:03:06.205 --> 00:03:08.015
mbx gc.

76
00:03:08.015 --> 00:03:09.665
Dry run first, naturally.

77
00:03:09.665 --> 00:03:10.195
straw...

78
00:03:10.195 --> 00:03:10.700
straw-ber...

79
00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:11.180
straw-ber...

80
00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:12.810
straw-ber-ry...

81
00:03:14.115 --> 00:03:16.080
Pray silence for...

82
00:03:18.105 --> 00:03:19.810
Mister Boxington!

83
00:03:21.825 --> 00:03:23.270
Mister Boxington!

84
00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:25.118
HIT! HIT! STRAWBERRY!

85
00:03:25.118 --> 00:03:26.958
HIT! MISS! STRAWBERRY!

86
00:03:26.958 --> 00:03:28.820
HIT! HIT! STRAWBERRY!

87
00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.670
HIT! MISS! STRAWBERRY!

88
00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:33.905
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

89
00:03:33.905 --> 00:03:35.600
hey hey hey hey hey hey hey hey hey hey hey hey hey hey hey

90
00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:36.585
Still counts.

91
00:03:36.585 --> 00:03:38.195
Mister Boxington!

92
00:03:40.285 --> 00:03:41.895
Mister Boxington!

93
00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.395
Mister Boxington!

94
00:03:45.395 --> 00:03:47.150
Oh, go on then.

95
00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:47.645
Right!

96
00:03:47.645 --> 00:03:48.900
Mister Boxington!

97
00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:51.330
Monocle off!

98
00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.965
Mister Boxington!

99
00:03:58.658 --> 00:04:00.155
Mister Boxington!

100
00:04:00.155 --> 00:04:02.405
HIT! HIT! HIT! HIT! HIT!

101
00:04:02.405 --> 00:04:03.830
Mister Boxington!

102
00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:06.053
HIT! HIT! HIT! HIT! HIT!

103
00:04:06.053 --> 00:04:07.705
Mister Boxington!

104
00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:18.820
He would never say he's proud

105
00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:23.150
But his cheeks say it out loud

106
00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:28.200
Build's finished. I'll see myself out.
